# Commerce self-service

Commerce is a kiosk mode. The television home stays the default.

- Show products, a cart, a QR session, fulfillment, and a digital receipt.
- Keep cash, drawers, printers, and cashier screens out of the customer flow.
- Mark every simulated charge on the screen and in the payload.

```tsx
if (!order.paymentCaptured) showWaiting();
```

Do not put MQTT, adapter forms, or device ids on the kiosk. Do not replace `/` with the store.
